window.products.push({"id":1180180,"name":"Wired Earbuds TRI Star River 10mm Beryllium Dynamic Driver IEMs in-Ear Earphone with Detachable 2Pin 3.5/4.4 Plug OFC Cable 3D-Printed Shell dual swit","category":"electronics","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613YaDWFg+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【10mm Beryllium dynamic driver & 6mm metal Titanium diaphragm】Through careful R&D, Star River in ear monitors adopted new Beryllium dynamic driver to present unique timbre of Beryllium metal diaphragm and rich details.To maintain similar metal timbre of Beryllium and overall performance of the whole earphone driver, TRI customized a 6mm metal Titanium diaphragm to ensure more excellent high-frequency performance for Star River.And not only that,Dual dynamics adopted N52 strong magnet as driver. 10mm Beryllium dynamic driver has a magnetic flux over 1 Tesla to provide huge power,So it is easy to drive. 【Precision acoustic conduit & Integrated switch crossover】Through parallel connection of precision conduit, dual dynamic drivers achieved the combination of acoustic cavities. Benefited from three-hole independent pressure equalization design, a more balanced acoustic effect can be realized. Acoustic performance can be stably ensured under different tuning modes. 【Four-core litz braided structure OFC Detachable 2Pin Cable】Detachable 2pin braided cables made of 5N oxygen-free copper plated with silver wire, custom wires allows easy replacement or customization.The in ear headphones come with high-purity OFC with silver plated wire core has been used to ensure for good timbre during transmission.offer Powerful bass & Cohesive mids 【Precision dual switches of tuning】Star River in-ear headphones adopted precision electronic crossover tuning switches. Four kinds of different styles can be achieved through enhancement effect to different units. Users can adjust based on personal preference. 【Skin-friendly resin & One-piece reverse molding process 】the wired earbuds IEMs use skin-friendly resin can effectively avoid allergy problem caused by material.The one-piece seamless molding process makes the cavity to be more complete. Benefited from the stable physical and chemical properties of resin, Star River can withstand challenge from different environment.Each IEM is meticulously crafted and hand-made, beautiful, just like exquisite handicrafts. 【Comfortable Fit & Noise Isolation】The earphone uses 3D printing technology to simulate human ears through a computer simulation database to match the best engineering of the human body. This technology allows star river to achieve a perfect fit, even if you wear it for a long time, you will not feel tired and uncomfortable,TRI Audio offers hi-res audiophile fidelity combined with a solidly built and great value Ergonomic In-Ear Wired Headphones, perfect for listening to music and keeping surrounding noise out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613YaDWFg+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H HIFIHEAR","source_asin":"B0BGZCYDR5","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180180","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGZCYDR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGZCYDR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
