window.products.push({"id":1180321,"name":"StarTech.com 3ft (1m) HDMI 2.1 Cable 8K - Certified Ultra High Speed HDMI Cable 48Gbps - 8K 60Hz/4K 120Hz HDR10+ eARC - Ultra HD 8K HDMI Cable - Monit","category":"electronics","retail price":24.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JAGuXWToL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 3.3 ft. (1 m) Ultra High Speed HDMI 2.1 Certified Cable withstands the daily demands of connecting your HDMI devices. Tested to endure strenuous wear and tear, this durable cable is a must-have for both business and consumer applications. Experience the latest that HDMI 2.1 has to offer This high performance 8K cable supports resolutions of up to 8K at 60Hz (7680x4620p), 5K at 60Hz, 4K at 120Hz and bandwidths of up to 48Gbps. It also supports HDR10+ (High Dynamic Range) and Dolby Vision for higher contrast ratio and vivid colors. Plus, eARC (Enhanced Audio Return Channel) has up to 32 uncompressed 5.1 and 7.1 digital audio channels to support DTS-HD Master Audio™; DTS:X®; Dolby® TrueHD, Dolby Atmos® for high quality sound. Latest HDCP 2.3 encrypts and secures your video and audio content. With higher resolutions, increased speeds, sharper images, and crystal-clear audio, you can expect an enhanced video experience. The cable is guaranteed to provide the very best HDMI 8K performance available today. It's the perfect cable for creating the ultimate home theater or for providing lifelike digital signage. This cable works with all 8K ready devices and is also backward compatible with previous HDMI specifications. Provide superior connections with Ultra High Speed certification The cable has undergone rigorous compliance testing and is certified by an HDMI Authorized Test Center to ensure it supports the high bandwidth enabled features it promises. An EMI test is also performed to ensure the cable minimizes interference with wireless signals. Cable Key Features Aluminum-mylar foil with braided shielding improve EMI protection Long lasting flexible TPE jacket & strain relief (TPE is non-toxic & halogen free for environmental sustainability) Insulated conductors reduce friction, provide more flexibility Connector","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JAGuXWToL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StarTech","source_asin":"B0BSGJY2NK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180321","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSGJY2NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSGJY2NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1180322,"name":"Picun Wireless Earbuds Bluetooth Headphones Half In Ear IPX7 Waterproof 20 Hours Playtime HD Stereo Sound, Mono/Twin Mode, Built-in Mic/Touch Control/","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uEbZeQjVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Bluetooth 5.0 & Pick-up Connection】Picun W18 True wireless earbuds provide a faster transmission rate and stable connection with no signal loss or music dropout. After the first pairing, the wireless earbuds will connect with your devices automatically once you pick up them out of the charging case. These earbuds are compatible with smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other Bluetooth devices for more flexibility and convenience. 【Hifi Stereo Sound & Clear Hands-free Call】 Equipped with powerful 10mm speaker driver unit, these Bluetooth 5.0 earbuds delivers stereo sound beside your ear with mellow bass and clear treble, reproducing your music vividly. With the built-in HD microphone, your voice comes through loud and clear whether you’re on a video conference or catching up with your friends. 【Ultra Lightweight & Half In-Ear】Wireless earbuds use an ultra-light mini design, only 3.7g for each earbud, you can hardly feel its weight. The ergonomic half in-ear design makes the earbuds fit in your ear canals more secure and comfortable, they're not easy to loose or fall off. The W18 Bluetooth earbuds can bring you a long-time comfortable fitting experience. 【Mono Mode & Twin Mode】Picun Bluetooth Earbuds have no limitation of the main/master earbud, you no longer have to wear a fixed earbud for single-ear mode. You can choose mono mode while talking with friends, or switch to twin mode to enjoy better stereo music. Meets your daily use requirements for different occasions. 【IPX7 Waterproof Protection + Simple Touch Control】These wireless in-ear earbuds are IPX7 Waterproof, which can effectively prevent the damage of sweat, raindrops, or spilled liquid. With the touch sensor, you can control your playlist and volume by tapping your earbuds, truly reach the freedom of movement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uEbZeQjVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Picun","source_asin":"B09BQV6FQK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180322","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQV6FQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQV6FQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
