window.products.push({"id":1180410,"name":"XIYXIN 4K Video Camera Camcorder Video Camera for YouTube Video Recorder 64MP 60FPS 4.0\" Touch Screen 18X Digital Zoom Vlogging Camera for YouTube wit","category":"electronics","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H0JYZwKZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[4K Camcorder 64MP and 18X Digital Zoom] Our upgraded camcorder has 4K clear video and 64MP vivid pictures. The 4-inch touch screen is easier to operate and displays your video and pictures clearly. 4K camera also has 18x zoom function, can meet your various shooting needs. [Webcam function and HDMI output] This YouTube camera can be used as a webcam when you use your desktop for daily video calls. It provides quality video streaming on social media, such as Facebook, YouTube, Twitter, etc. You can also connect the camera 4K to your HDTV via HDMI cable to play photos and videos, and share memories with the whole family. [WiFi and 2.4G remote control]This 4K camera supports WiFi wireless transmission, so you can transfer and view images and videos at any time. You can not only control YouTube Vlogging camera remotely via WiFi, but also control the camera from 360° via 2.4G remote control, which is very convenient for selfie or home shooting without members in the group photo. [Stabilizer and video recording while charging] This 4K camcorder is equipped with a stabilizer. With the stabilizer, you can shoot low-angle video as well as steady video. There is an additional video switch and zoom button on the stabilizer. When the camcorder camera is fully charged, it can continue recording for about 3 hours. YouTube's camcorder supports recording while charging, and you can also use a USB cable to connect the camcorder to an additional mobile power source for charging. [Pause Function and Auto Focus] You can pause the recording when you need to, and then resume it again without starting a new recording. YouTube camera supports two modes: auto focus and manual focus, you can switch between them according to your different shooting needs to get clear and beautiful pictures and videos.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H0JYZwKZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XIYXIN","source_asin":"B0BZRWFWFJ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180410","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZRWFWFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZRWFWFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
