window.products.push({"id":1180468,"name":"PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution Flat Panel in-Wall Cable Management Kit with AV and Dual HDMI (White)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rxSLswTBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The PowerBridge TS-CVAH2-6 is an in-wall power extension and cable management system with dual HDMI, specifically designed to provide a one-step professional appearance that hides AV cables and provides pass-thru or cable-connection jacks for your HDMI sources such as any on-wall mounted LCD, Plasma, or OLED HDTV. From the Manufacturer The PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution with Dual HDMI and Component Video Cable Connects Is the Ultimate in Cable Management Let's say you're preparing to install a new flat screen HDTV or a projector. Or you've already installed your TV with the cord in the wall, or left it hanging down, \"out there\" on the wall. Either way, you still need a power-outlet to plug it into in addition to managing all those cables. The PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution with dual HDMI and Component Video Cable Connects is an in-wall power extension and cable management system, specifically designed to provide a one-step professional appearance that hides AV cables and provides dual HDMI and Component Video cable-connection jacks for any on-wall mounted LCD, Plasma, or OLED HDTV. Protect Your TV with PowerBridge's Easy Integration Into Your Existing Power Protection Equipment An in-wall extension and cable management system designed for a professional appearance Having a regular A/C outlet/receptacle installed behind your expensive wall mounted HDTV will provide A/C power, but unless you have a whole-house, main panel protection system installed, the outlets in your home are un-protected from surge power and \"dirty\", noisy power which can reduce the life of electronics and power supplies. The PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution with Cable Connects makes protecting your investment easy with the ability to connect an external power surge protector, power conditioner, or UPS device to provide a completely safe and protected power solution to your home theater equipment. The PowerBridge design allows power out from the protection device through the supplied 6' power cord plugged into the PowerBridge POWER-INLET, delivering protected power up the wall to the TV. The PowerBridge Solution Is More Than an Ordinary Extension Cord Conceal all of your cables with a Total Solution Depending on your local code requirements, several rated types of in-wall rated power wire are used. The most commonly used type in the US is best known as ROMEX, made specifically to use inside wall and ceilings to connect all of your electrical outlets, switches and light fixtures. Flexible extension cords are not made with materials fire rated to use inside a wall to connect in-wall mounted electrical devises, as referenced in the National Electrical Code as Not Permitted Use. But the PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution is installed using specific types of UL-listed, in-wall-rated building electrical wire. The wire makes a direct \"extension\" by connecting the upper Power OUT wall plate to the lower Power IN wall plate together, resulting in a code-compliant in-wall power extension. Totally Flexible Design The unique patent-pending Slim-Line Design is less than 3\" high and 9\" long, and is shaped like most wall mounts. The Total Solution can be installed directly below, above, or in-between the wall mount--or vertically next to a single-stud mount. The PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution with dual HDMI and Component Video Cable Connects is also the onlydesign currently on the market that will hide behind any size or type of wall-mounted HDTV. Also featured is a reversible cable pass-thru port with modular \"scoops\" to guide wires through an in-wall installation or as a hood to protect external cables from being crunched behind heavy AV equipment. The AV cable connects plate is also removable to allow for optional Decora inserts for added cable port connection. (Decora inserts sold separately.) Safe, Do-It-Yourself Installation The PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution is not wired into, nor does it make direct connection to, the actual electrical wiring/circuit. In other words, you're safe, no risk of shock. You will not be in contact with live electricity during your installation. PowerBridge makes it easy with color-coded wire connections and clear, easy-to-understand illustrated instructions. Usual installation time is less than 30 minutes. Save Money With the PowerBridge TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution there is no electrician needed. This product is DIY and easy to install. Everything is included, from instructions to the wall-cutout template--all you need are basic tools. Expandable With Optional Decora Inserts (Sold Separately) Need more connection options? The Cable Connects plate in the TS-CVH2-6 is swappable with a selection of compatible PowerBridge Decora inserts (sold separately). Add HDMI and other video connections, or RCA audio to help you build the perfect solution for your home theater. Included with the TS-CVH2-6 Total Solution with Cable Connects What's in the Box? (Included Accessories) PowerOU","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rxSLswTBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PowerBridge Solutions","source_asin":"B003ZHTUG0","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180468","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003ZHTUG0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003ZHTUG0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
