window.products.push({"id":1180609,"name":"Riverstone Audio - Rock & Roll Series 380 Record Weight Turntable Stabilizer (380 g) - Anodized Aluminum - Laser Engraved Surface - Vinyl Angel - Colo","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917KQwJ3FyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Riverstone Audio's Rock & Roll record weights - Vinyl Angel engraving. What can we say, we like Rock & Roll and vinyl records and couldn't settle for a boring record weight. Our R&R 380 record weights are definitely not your average record weight - they combine . The top surface of the best in engineering and material with art. This particular weight has a finely detailed laser etching of \"Vinyl Angel\" and brings to mind classic R&R from the 60's, 70's and 80's. We believe that audio products should be designed and manufactured to exacting standards using the best available materials and with close attention to detail. The weight is ergonomically designed for easy gripping and CNC machined from 7075-T6 aluminum (one of the best aerospace grade aluminum alloys). The attention to detail does not stop with the material and design. To protect your LP record labels and provide additional damping, a 1 mm thick EVA pad is affixed to the base of the record weight. A foam-lined wooden box (pine) is also included to protect your record weight when not in use. Specifications: Mass 380 g, Dimensions: 34.5 mm height, maximum diameter (at base) 80.0 mm, Spindle hole 7.25 mm diameter x 20 mm deep. Color: - Viper Red. Laser engraving: \"Vinyl Angel\" text and image on top surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917KQwJ3FyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riverstone Audio","source_asin":"B07DYPD9JR","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180609","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DYPD9JR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DYPD9JR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1180610,"name":"Boston Acoustics Soundware XS 2.1 Home Stereo Speaker System (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qZPAzhShL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The SoundWare XS 2.1 Loudspeaker System is an ultra-compact stereo speaker system with powered subwoofer that brings a new level of style and substance to your music listening experience. It allows users to enjoy rich, room-filling sound, while complementing virtually any décor in a stylish yet subtle (even virtually unnoticeable, if desired) manner. The system's two ultra-compact and stylish SoundWare XS satellites are real two-way speakers (unlike many competitors). Each features a high-performance 2 1/2-inch (64mm) woofer and a 1/2-inch (13mm) tweeter. And, wall brackets are included for easy corner or wall-mounted installation. The contoured-rectangle subwoofer, colored to match the satellites in either black or white, features a 100-watt (250 watts peak) amplifier and 8-inch (203mm) driver.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qZPAzhShL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston Acoustics","source_asin":"B00IOG3URW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180610","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IOG3URW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IOG3URW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
