window.products.push({"id":1180691,"name":"Lightning to SD/TF Card Camera Reader/Adapter, Trail and Game Camera Viewer Reader for iPhone/iPad, 3 in 1 SD Card Reader for iPhone X/8 Plus/8/7 Plus","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HhrmeotpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Why choose Tania SD Card Camera Reader For photographers, save time much faster than using Wi-Fi: Save money on the extra Wi-Fi function for your camera. Share your photos and videos of your camera on your social network freely.Release the space of your SD card and backup your SD card. Copy the movie from SD card to your iPhone & iPad and watch and edit them easily. Import the photos and videos from your dash cam (car black box) or home camera (with tf card), unmanned aerial vehicle (those with tf card to record the view). Specification: Working Voltage: 3.3V Working Current: <100mAh Port: Lightning port/SD card slot/TF card slot/USB female socket Data transfer Speed: USB 2.0 speed ( 14MB/S ~ 16MB/S) How to use it to transfer photos and videos from your camera? 1. Turn on your iPhone or iPad and connect the Lightning to USB Camera Adapter to the Lighting 2. Turn on your camera and connect it to the adapter using the USB cable that came with your camera 3. Your iPad or iPhone will open the photos app automatically 3-7 seconds after connecting this adapter, and then you can choose photos or videos you like to import Note: 1. This adapter doesn't support USB device(usb flash disk, hubs, keyboard, etc.) over 100mA current.  2. SD/TF card reader and USB interface cannot be used at the same time.  3. If photos were not taken by the digital camera, use your computer, create a folder called \"DCIM\" to the root of your memory card. Copy the photos and videos into the DCIM folder. Rename each photo and video file as \"IMG_XXXX\", where XXXX is a unique number. For example, if you had one JPG file and one .MOV file, name them \"IMG_0001.JPG\" and \"IMG_0002.MOV\".4. If photos or videos aren’t transferring, be sure the memory card is inserted properly into the Lightning to SD Card Camera Reader.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HhrmeotpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tania","source_asin":"B07BQR62GC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180691","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BQR62GC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BQR62GC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
