window.products.push({"id":1180877,"name":"Dracaena High Flow 12v dc Water Pump Combo Computer Water Cooler, Water Pump for Computer Water Cooling Systems OD 50mm, ID 40mm, 54mm Length (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o8a4b3qZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description: Water Cooling Components - Pumps. ... The pump in your water cooling loop is what makes it possible to move heat from your PC's components to the radiator, where it's moved to the outside air. Without coolant flow a water cooling system doesn't work. At the radiator, the water is pushed through a network of even narrower channels, which are cooled by having air blown over them by a fan. ... The water then flows back to the reservoir and begins its journey again Advantages of water cooling pump: A water cooling kit will reduce the need to use more than one fan in your PC case. The self-contained loop of water cools quietly, so you don’t have to worry about loud fans breaking your focus while fighting that last big boss in your favorite game. Pump Specification: Rate of flow: 800L/hour Head of delivery: 3.5 meter Current rating: 0.7A Voltage: DC12V-13.5V Rated power: 7W Weight: 370g Speed: 3000-5000RPM Terminal: 4D+4pin Operating temperature:55 degrees hightest The motor type: Brushless, microprocessor control Support PWM Support RGB remote control Water Tank Specification: Outer Diameter:50mm Inner Diameter: 40mm Length: 54mm Material: Top - POM Body - Acrylic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o8a4b3qZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dracaena","source_asin":"B09M8H8Y3C","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180877","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M8H8Y3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M8H8Y3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1180878,"name":"Monster Pro MI Professional Surge Protector Power Strip with Fireproof MOV Technology for Computers, Amplifiers, Pedal Boards, and Pro Audio Gear, 135","category":"electronics","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XLtRpCIUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADVANCED SURGE PROTECTION CIRCUITRY: Ensure the safety of your expensive equipment like computers, pro audio gear, and home entertainment systems from potentially damaging power fluctuations like lightning strikes, overloading, and power strikes FIREPROOF MOV TECHNOLOGY: This Monster power strip has Fireproof MOV (Metal Oxide Varistor) Technology to protect your electronics from storms and surges; the MOV component absorbs excess energy then dissipates it as heat, keeping your family and home safer from home electrical fires CLEAN UNINTERRUPTED POWER: The power strip features Monster Clean Power technology that filters out electromagnetic and radio frequency interference (EMI/RFI interference) for crystal clear picture and sound quality CONVENIENT FEATURES: Featuring a tough metal case, 1 wide-spaced outlet, and a right-angle plug; the built-in LED light indicates active surge protection for connected devices and that the wiring is properly grounded SAFETY AGENCY CERTIFIED: The ETL Listed Mark serves as proof that the power strip has been tested independently by Intertek and found to be in compliance with widely accepted product safety standards","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XLtRpCIUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monster","source_asin":"B09L7S32LW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180878","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L7S32LW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L7S32LW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1180879,"name":"MARSTUDY 3A Raspberry Pi 4 Model B Power Supply, USB-C, US Plug with On/Off Pi Switch, Black","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HNcMW2W6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MARSTUDY 3A USB-C power supply (UL Listed) is specially designed and tested for the Raspberry Pi 4. MARSTUDY power supply incorporates a noise filter to provide the highest power stability.  It incorporates a thick 18 AWG and well insulated cable with a 5-foot cable length. MARSTUDY PiSwitch provides a premium quality and reliable power switch to the Raspberry Pi 4! It is made of high quality elements to minimize electrical resistance.  A low quality switch can result in high electrical resistance and reduced voltage,  and so the switch conductivity and material is essential when used with the Raspberry Pi4. Important Note Compatible with Raspberry Pi 4 B only. Not compatible with Raspberry Pi 3 B, B+, A+ or Pi Zero. Specifications Output voltage: + 5.1V  DC minimum load current: 0A  Nominal load current: 3A  Maximum Power: 15W  Load regulation: ± 5%  Line regulation: ± 2%  Ripple and noise: 120mVp-p Protection:  Short circuit protection  Overcurrent protection  Overheat protection  Efficiency: Minimum 81% (output current from 100%, 75% , 50%, 25%)  Minimum 72% with 10% load  Output cable: 1.5m 18AWG  Output connector: USB Type-C  Input Voltage range:  100-240Vac (rated)  96-264Vac (during operation)  Frequency: 50 / 60Hz ± 3Hz  Current: 0.5A maximum  Power consumption (no load): Maximum 0.075W  Inrush current: No damage, input fuse will not blow  Environment Operating ambient temperature rature 0–40 ° C Compliance The Raspberry Pi 18W USB-C power supply has undergone extensive compliance testing and meets many regional and international standards such as UL, PES and TÜV. Tips It can damage the card just to unplug the power. So we recommend pulling the power after issuing sudo shutdown command.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HNcMW2W6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARSTUDY","source_asin":"B08136G98S","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180879","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08136G98S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08136G98S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
