window.products.push({"id":1180959,"name":"Samsung NX GN20 Flash","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719H3NOm3QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Samsung SEF220 flash is designed to work with Samsung NX and EX series cameras. The adjustable flash provides automatic TTL exposure control making low light photography a breeze. This small, yet powerful flash has a Guide Number of 16m(52.5') in wide mode and a Guide Number of 22m(72') while in the tele mode. From the Manufacturer Create just the right lighting for your photos with the ED-SEF220A external flash from Samsung. Designed to attach to the hot shoe mount of a Samsung NX series camera, this flash has an auto TTL setting, which automatically sets the light based on the conditions. It also offers tele mode or wide mode to give you greater control. Adjustable bounce settings help eliminate unwanted shadows. The adjustable bounce settings help you eliminate unwanted shadows. View larger . The ED-SEF220A flash works with Samsung NX series digital cameras. View larger . Automatic and Manual Flash Settings The ED-SEF220A features several flash options to choose from depending on your preference, your level of experience, and the needs of the shot. The auto TTL (through-the-lens) flash function analyzes the distance and ambient lighting of the shot and then automatically provides the right amount of flash when the shutter is released. This allows for subtle low-light flash and fill-flash photography. The tele mode and wide mode allow you to further control the amount of light for taking natural images in low-light conditions. Bounce Flash for Natural-Looking Photos Adjustable bounce settings allow you to use the ED-SEF220A flash to eliminate unwanted shadows and achieve precise lighting effects with each shot. The flash is powerful enough to cover long distances both indoors and outdoors, yet sensitive enough for subtle, low-light compositions. Small, Lightweight Design Made to fit Samsung NX series digital cameras, the ED-SEF220A flash features a compact, lightweight design that won't affect your shooting style and is easy to store transport. Product Information The ED-SEF220A runs on two AAA batteries (not included). It measures 63 by 61 by 27.5 millimeters (H x W x D) and weighs 104 grams without the batteries. What's in the Box Samsung ED-SEF220A external flash and carry case pouch. ED-SEF220 Flash At a Glance: Optimized for use with Samsung NX series digital cameras Optimized for use with Samsung NX series digital cameras Auto TTL setting Auto TTL setting Tele and wide modes for greater control and accuracy Tele and wide modes for greater control and accuracy Adjustable bounce settings to eliminate shadows Adjustable bounce settings to eliminate shadows Compact, lightweight design Compact, lightweight design Click each image to enlarge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719H3NOm3QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B007XJG4SS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180959","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007XJG4SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B007XJG4SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
