window.products.push({"id":1180961,"name":"4K HDMI to 5.1 Digital Analog Audio Decoder + EDID Switch 24-Bit 192Khz DAC","category":"electronics","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NZKVnWdnL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"This innovative HDMI surround audio processor can decode the digital AC3, DTS 5.1 or PCM audio embedded in HDMI and output in analog surround sound format through its discrete RCA outputs and headphone style 3.5mm output. With the advanced 24bit /192KHz DAC built in, your CD/MP3 music, DVD movies or online game comes alive when played through home theater system, powered speakers, subwoofers or headphone. The decoded analog audio output from this device will retain an accurate duplicate of sound for true cinema experience with rich and vibrant audio. A cost-efficient solution for integrating the HDMI-based AV equipment with analog amplifier, receiver or hometheater system. Clear And Discrete Surround Sound Audio Outputs This HDMI audio converter provides 3 simultaneous analog audio outputs including 6-channel surround sound RCA outputs, stereo 2-channel output and headphone style 3.5mm output. Ultra HD 4K Input Support This audio decoder supports HDMI input resolutions up to 3840x2160 and 4096x2160 pixels at 30Hz with pass-through of all HDMI 3D video and deep color content. Premium 24-Bit 192Khz DAC This DAC signal processor is built with 24 bit/96KHz audio DSP and 24bit /192KHz DAC for accurate bit-for-bit D to A conversion of sound. Auto 5.1 Channel Surround Sound Input Detection If the LED for 5.1 input on the front panel is in green light, the HDMI source is confirmed to output 5.1 surround sound indeed. Easy EDID Switch For Audio Output Mode This unit is featured with EDID switch on the front panel for manually selecting between 5.1CH and 2CH audio output mode. External Volume Control The volume dial on the front panel can control the music output level from its RCA audio outputs and headphone port.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NZKVnWdnL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AllAboutAdapters","source_asin":"B07J3MJGNX","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180961","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J3MJGNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J3MJGNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
