window.products.push({"id":1180989,"name":"3Pack Charger Cable for Fitbit Luxe,Charging Fast USB Replacement Cord Accessory Compatible with Fitbit Luxe/Fitbit Charger 5,Pack of 3(3.3 ft/3.3 ft/","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYvbSaSEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Safe & Fast Charging for Luxe. This charger cable is designed for fitbit luxe only. The charger cable for fitbit luxe is made of good plastic, durable light and small, you could put the replacement charging cable for luxe in your car or office. The replacement charging cable cord for your fitbit luxe will charge your tracker fast and protect your luxe fitness tracker. This charger for luxe works with USB wall charger, powerbank, laptop computer and any USB devices. The package includes 3 charging cables for fitbit luxe, and we checked every one before shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYvbSaSEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZGBJSZ","source_asin":"B09FJDNZSH","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180989","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FJDNZSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FJDNZSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1180990,"name":"USB to USB Cable 15FT,Durable Braidedfor USB 3.0 Male to Male Type A to Type A Cable Data Transfer Compatible with Hard Drive, Laptop, DVD Player, TV,","category":"electronics","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VCCs-sMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LDKCOK USB 3.0 A Male to A Male Cable ● Gold Plated High-speed USB 3.0 Type A Male to Male Cable supports connecting USB 3.0 and USB 2.0 peripherals to computer (Mac or PC). The high-performance USB cable provides convenient connection to external hard drive enclosures(SSD or HDD), printer, modem, cameras, USB in car, set top box and other USB compatible devices. The combination of gold plated conductors and multiple foil & braid shielding layers improve data cable superior performance without data delay and data loss. High-speed USB 3.0 ● The USB 3.0 cable provides high-speed data transfer speed up to 5Gbps (USB 3.0 compliant source and target device),10x data transfer rate than USB 2.0. Nylon Tangle-free & High-performance Design ● Premium nylon braided cable adds additional durability and tangle free. ● Strong SR design withstands 10000+ bending test.  ● The premium aluminum alloy housing with surface oxidation treatment adds this USB cable more durability and give you a stylish shell and a great metallic texture. Backwards Compatible ● Backwards compatible with USB 2.0 and USB 1.1 ports No driver needed ● No driver needed for USB 3.0 A to A cable. Just plug-and-play for hard drive enclosures, laptop cooler, camera and other high-speed USB peripherals. Package Contents ● USB 3.0 Type A Male to Male Cable x1 Pcs Note ● In order to archive USB 3.0 performance, the source and target device shall be compliant with USB 3.0.  ● Do Not use as charging cable.  ● Do Not support connecting two computers directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VCCs-sMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LDKCOK","source_asin":"B078W9XK4N","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180990","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078W9XK4N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B078W9XK4N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1180991,"name":"Mirage OMDC2 Black 3-Way OMNIPOLAR(TM) Center Channel","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mIHaASYbL._AC_.jpg","description":"The three-way OMD-C2 center channel features Mirage’s proprietary OMNIPOLAR technology creating a 360-degree soundfield bringing movies and audio tracks to life. Never before has “being at the movies\" felt so realistic and so seamless. The OMD-C2 offers precise dialog placement while at the same time conveys a spaciousness and presence impossible for conventional forward radiating center channel speakers to achieve. Conventional forward radiating center channels are directional in dispersion and require that the listener be restricted to a “sweet spot\" in the desired sound field. The OMD-C2`s OMNIPOLAR technology is uniform in dispersion, providing a perfectly spherical, full spectrum sound radiation pattern that greatly expands the prime listening area. It is this 360 degree radiation pattern that allows the listener to be positioned anywhere in the room and off-axis of the center channel and still enjoy pinpoint imaging. The OMD-C2 is a true three way design featuring a 5.25-inch multi-layer carbon fibre/fibreglass hybrid midrange with underhung motor system, two 6.5-inch proprietary hybrid woofers and a 28mm chambered titanium dome tweeter. Two sets of gold plated binding posts allow the center channel to be bi-amp and/or bi-wired. The beautiful hand lacquered curved cabinet is available in high gloss piano black. The OMD-C2s stunning appearance and its impressive sound guarantee to make this center channel a timeless classic for all music and home theater enthusiasts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mIHaASYbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mirage","source_asin":"B000WVIVIU","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180991","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000WVIVIU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000WVIVIU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
