window.products.push({"id":1180999,"name":"Vivitek D509 2600 Lumen XGA 3-D Ready Portable DLP Projector (White)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w4i3xiS+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Vivitek D509 XGA digital projector offer 2600 lumens of brightness, 3000:1 contrast ratio and DLP and BrilliantColor technologies for sharp, detailed images. This projector is also 3D-ready to ensure future media content can be displayed. With a variety of functions and features, the Vivitek D509 will put your presentation in the spotlight. Ships with: AC Power Cord, VGA Cable, Remote Control, Batteries for Remote, Carrying Case, User’s Manual (CD), Lens Cap, Warranty Card. From the Manufacturer Be presentation-ready with the Vivtek D509 2600 Lumen XGA 3-D Ready Portable DLP Projector (White). This ROHS-compliant and 3D-ready projector utilizes Texas Instruments' DLP and BrilliantColor technologies for sharp, vivid images and attention-grabbing color. Packed with innovative features, the D508 helps take your presentations to the next level. Vivitek D509 XGA Projector With 2600 Lumens and a 3000:1 contrast ratio, you'll have a bright, beautiful picture. View larger . DLP DarkChip and BrilliantColor Technology for a Bright, Crisp Picture Whether you're pitching a new idea to clients or planning to amaze your colleagues with your latest presentation, the D509's projection quality is sure to impress. This projector utilizes Texas Instruments' DLP DarkChip and BrilliantColor technologies for sharp color and high contrast. With its native XGA resolution (able to display up to UXGA 1600 x 1200), the D509 delivers brilliant digital images with full-color saturation for a high-impact experience. For versatility, its 3000:1 contrast ratio and bright 2600 lumens ensure vivid and stunning images in various light conditions. Enhanced Features for the Latest Multimedia Applications Closed-caption and 3D ready, the D509 can handle all the latest multimedia applications. Enhanced color and display adjustments give you the clearest, brightest picture possible, while high-efficiency lamps last up to 4,000 hours (in economy mode) for long-term use. The projector's rapid on/off cuts down on time-wasting delays, and the keypad-lock feature helps you avoid accidental changes to the settings. 3D-Ready Projection Create an immersive experience with DLP-Link 3D and DLP technology, which uses millions of microscopic, digital mirrors that reflect light to create a stunning picture. This imaging technology is so fast, it can actually produce two images on the screen at the same time: one for the \"left\" eye and one for the \"right\" eye. Then, 3D glasses (sold separately) combine the two images to create an amazing 3D effect. When you purchase a DLP-Link 3D-ready projector like this one, you'll be ready to input 3D content and create a truly memorable experience. The projector includes a range of connections including Composite Video, S-Video, and VGA. View larger . Lightweight, User-Friendly Design The user-friendly D509 features a RS-232c port so you can control your projector from a personal computer, enabling you to integrate it with third-party control systems for one-touch control. At 10.28 x 3.07 x 7.48 inches (W x H x D) and weighing just 4.2 pounds, the projector is travel-ready and easy to move around and transition from tabletop to ceiling mount for placement at the ideal angle. Quiet Operation Designed to run quieter than other small DLP projectors, the D509 produces an operating noise of just 31/28 decibels (standard/economic mode). This means you can place the projector close by without worrying about excessive fan noise detracting from the on-screen content. Plug-Ins and Compatibility The D509 features a range of plug-ins, including VGA-In, Audio RCA L/R, Audio Mini-Jack, Composite Video, and S-Video. It's also UXGA, WXGA, SXGA+, SXGA, XGA, SVGA, VGA Resized; VESA Standards; PC and Macintosh Compatible. What's in the Box AC Power Cord; VGA cable; remote control; batteries for remote; carrying case; user's manual on CD; lens cap; and warranty card. Vivitek D509 XGA Projector At a glance: 3D DLP Link- and closed-caption-ready projector for great presentations 3D DLP Link- and closed-caption-ready projector for great presentations XGA resolution and amazing 3000:1 contrast ratio for vivid images XGA resolution and amazing 3000:1 contrast ratio for vivid images DLP and BrilliantColor technologies for sharp and detailed image quality DLP and BrilliantColor technologies for sharp and detailed image quality Bright 2600 lumens for various lighting conditions Bright 2600 lumens for various lighting conditions 1-year warranty on parts; 90 days on lamp 1-year warranty on parts; 90 days on lamp","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w4i3xiS+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vivitek","source_asin":"B003A4HE98","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1180999","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003A4HE98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003A4HE98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
